<title>POLAND: Polish Forte trades on kerb at PLN 11.9.</title>
<headline>Polish Forte trades on kerb at PLN 11.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 50,000 shares of Forte SA at 11.9 zlotys a share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Forte was flat at 11.9 zlotys in 66,653 share volume. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
